      "report": "Feature: Switch server becomes reachable again\nExpected: The mock console shows at least 1 connected client for 'Weichen'; in the app the switches are no longer red and there is no error message about 'Weichen'\nObserved failure: The app side recovered. After 'Weichen' was taken offline, the app showed the alert \"Fehler: Der Server „Weichen\" ist nicht erreichbar. Es wird versucht, die Verbindung wiederherzustellen.\" and all switches read \"keine Verbindung\". After clicking 'Bring Weichen online' and waiting 15 seconds, reopening the app showed no error message, all switches read \"Stellung gerade\", and the screenshot shows neutral (not red) switch symbols. The client count did not recover: the mock console row for 'Weichen' read Status \"Online\" but \"Connected clients\" was \"0\", not at least 1. Within the 15 seconds the app had not reconnected to the switch server, even though it no longer reported the server as unreachable.\nSteps completed before failure: 10"
